figdown 0.1 bitfield
# The classic form (`field <name> <width>`) and the compact form
# (`field a:1, b:2`) may not be mixed inside ONE line. 0.1 narrowed
# this case: `field a:1, b:2 fill=#fff` used to error here because the compact
# list was re-read from the RAW source line, so the option text landed inside
# the last item. Options are line-wide on the compact form now (see
# 416-bitfield-compact-options); what stays illegal is mixing the two SHAPES.
bitfield x "X" numbering=lsb0
field "OK" 8
field Name 8, c:2
# a forgotten comma is not a second separator either
field a:1 b:2
